    "innovation": "This paper systematically evaluates the accuracy, flexibility, and computational cost of three methods for treating overlapping gaseous absorption in correlated-k models of hot Jupiter and brown dwarf atmospheres, providing practical recommendations for their use in 1D and 3D simulations.",
